# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# DeepDive Interviewer — Frontend Environment Variables (Vercel)
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# In production (Vercel), set this to your Render backend URL (no trailing slash).
# Example: https://deepdive-backend.onrender.com
# In local development, leave this empty to use the Vite proxy defined in vite.config.js.
VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-service.onrender.com
